// ModelWeave Inference Protocol (mwip), version 1: the Registry service.
//
// The ModelWeave gateway implements Registry; engine instances are the
// clients. An instance is one engine server running one model in one role
// (encode, prefill, decode or unified). A model is served by many instances,
// in different roles.
//
// Lifecycle: an instance is registered by its first Heartbeat and stays
// registered while it sends one at least every HeartbeatResponse.ttl_ms; an
// instance whose heartbeats stop expires after that. Deregister removes an
// instance at once (graceful shutdown).
